<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰπεινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰπύς</span>)
		poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high, lofty</i>, of cities on
			heights, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.419
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				284
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				858
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1000
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					8.34
				</span></i>
			; of Delphi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαντεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					739
				</span></i>
			; of mountain-tops, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.869
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.123
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. λόγοι</span>
			<i>hasty, wicked</i> words, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hard to reach</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφίαι μὲν
			αἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.108
			</span></i>.</div>
